{"title":"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Speedy)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Speedy)</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find the smallest whole number that is larger than the sum\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/9/35976a4939b2325cb240645d8b440c560c990701.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2\\dfrac{1}{2}+3\\dfrac{1}{3}+4\\dfrac{1}{4}+5\\dfrac{1}{5}.\\]\" width=\"158\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/d/62d0dfd22acdbbefc466b0d5f3b4d3c125e5b959.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 14 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 15 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 16 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 17 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"375\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Adding the whole numbers gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/0/420fe3f0882d732b654bf68f3ee8f41c81314060.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 3 + 4 + 5 = 14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"145\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Adding the fractions gives <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/5/d952f77b8cf3b7bd00404f2190b0b8660586fa8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{4} + \\frac{1}{5} = \\frac{30}{60} + \\frac{20}{60} + \\frac{15}{60} + \\frac{12}{60} = \\frac{77}{60}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"343\" height=\"38\" />.  This will create one more whole, and a fraction that is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.  Thus, the smallest whole number that is less than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> plus some fractional part is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Convert the fractional parts to decimals, and approximate the answer.  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/e/4aedb1fd19446baac695f9bb9b364667b0406a8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2.5 + 3.33 + 4.25 + 5.2 = 15.28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"242\" height=\"14\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/5/9a5b4928c8fe50ce3c2428da3bee3505e891b788.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Speedy.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Speedy)\">Solution 3 (Speedy)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Speedy)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Clearly, break the mixed numbers into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/3/c/93cce9fe4ad72c1aa0fac28093827eb87a25fc9b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+3+4+5+\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3} + \\frac{1}{4} + \\frac{1}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"246\" height=\"38\" />. \n</p><p>This is the same as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/6/fb6cc1c8f7932f89959604bbc7d7ad934cdde44a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$14+(\\frac{1}{2} + \\frac{1}{3}) + (\\frac{1}{4} + \\frac{1}{5})$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"189\" height=\"38\" />. Notice that clearly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/c/c1c901d28745fe7c2c8b3b469c46afb63fe66c08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{3}=\\frac{5}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"84\" height=\"37\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/a/b/6abca824814610b9d41f6d9c8090eae3c0745643.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1&gt;\\frac{1}{4}+\\frac{1}{5}&gt;\\frac{1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"121\" height=\"38\" /> (clearly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/3/d13ea569acff4f853478ae26281abb6318689781.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4}&gt;\\frac{1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"52\" height=\"38\" />). This means that the fractional parts is between 1 and 2, so when that is added to 14, the original expression is between 15, and 16. So the least integer that is bigger than this sum is clearly 16. So select <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f58d2efaaa17d28cec9dd927d78708a63b43e24.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{C}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"26\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p>~hastapasta\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME\" title=\"1995 AJHSME\">1995 AJHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=42&amp;year=1995\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1995 AJHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1995_AJHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\